Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟大鸟一起去旅游！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 加油石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,噢噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那事不宜迟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是做这种事情的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微等下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我们邀请了佐久间同学跟楠木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,决定一起去海边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次跟朋友去海边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点害怕海水
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的身体与心理都做好了充足准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,最主要是我实在太期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不知不觉间去海边玩这件事不断扩散…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,泳装OK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,毛巾OK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,防晒霜也带了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,辰太 帮我跟羊平问个好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,今天终于迎来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,期待已久的海边旅行
Comment: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,============OP===========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拍咯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好像是海水浴场限定套装
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,海边欸 到海边了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这才刚到车站呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这回没睡懒觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.77,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚反而睡不着了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想到要跟大家一起去海边就很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难道大鸟也很紧张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 等下石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大海！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学的泳装
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,死缠烂打跟过来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别在这高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有种就碰一下石川试试
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道下场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 我现在就去…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.49,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,石川同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,爆头！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,流水加盐的双重打击
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗月菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没哭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,幸亏没被海浪刮走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学你的帽子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学的帽子就由我来…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不 应该是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是谁能将帽之皇冠收入囊中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,樫木台的黑色金枪鱼 千叶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,紧追其后的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,海之喜剧王 出口！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,双方展开了激烈对抗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么看这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,桥本解说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,太乱来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在搞啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你要快一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么胡话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手指比你先碰到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 接下来玩什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,话是这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但进入海水也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还是太难了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要玩沙滩排球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,难得来一趟 想进海水里试试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟大家一起玩水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,克服不擅长的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里还是能踩到地面的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很不安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不要碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好夸张的鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,噫 刚才踩到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,石川！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 为什么沉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她突然缩小了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好陷进去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,话说大鸟去哪了啊 在这种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 我来救…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他自己溺水了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那里明明能踩到底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 其实我也不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,辛亏有你们两个在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可千万别勉强自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好咸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是但是 可能稍微克服一点点了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你们了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是在海中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有大家的支撑…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,脚就没沾上去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 辰太
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,叔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了没 饭已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很能吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,边吃东西边说话会噎住的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好好配水  咀嚼一百下 别吃太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能继续吃下去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 这里好像也能买到刨冰哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,刨冰…我没吃过诶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就点一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在融化之前吃掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冰冰的真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一片深蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不治之症？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请问在座的各位中有医生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.20,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,有人吗有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是刨冰上的色素吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我家的外甥 竟然变得如此会照顾小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟君的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔 我们来玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的菜真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能和你的胃口真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,辰太这也是时隔许久了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,以前经常带朋友一起过来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去堆沙堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,沙堡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,叔叔 谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟  快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是青春呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会变成城堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,整个大的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,富士山那个级别的!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这规模可真大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,梦 就是要做大的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也来做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,做个城堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:18.95,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,教教我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,做个惊掉大家眼球的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:34.28,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,怎么样怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.26,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,我们这个可以获得头奖了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是玩什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学对我们笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么石川同学会？我也想看!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,沙子掉进嘴里了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么只有出口你看见了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是小学生吗
Comment: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,夕阳真是深入人心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我能懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会在这个点上同步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘞 追着夕阳长泳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,疼!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,天就要黑了 禁止游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼好疼好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 座长 你都已经有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还跟千叶…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那就改沙滩夺旗对决吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我来当裁判
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,玩累了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只是觉得从这里看过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,天空和大海真是漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是最佳观景点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.23,0:13:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在沙滩上的大伙都见得到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是观景的最佳方法就是大家一起看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 瑛子说了句不错的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能继续玩下去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这里这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,升空式的耶 不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大型烟火可是男人的浪漫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,记得点上火后要拉开5米以上的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就算火在中途熄灭了也别去戳别去看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,烟花带来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,给 石川同学的份
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,结衣酱 借个火哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学也要点火吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 真是漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间 楠木 要点火吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有样学样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点快点 不要要熄灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,看过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.25,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍咯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别挥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,很危险 放这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别样式的也有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别样式的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,果然拍不到石川同学吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,采访好像那次好像也是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我 好 恨 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,作为替代 我这么玩可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼火烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成灵异烟花的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,除了鬼火烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这种的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个和这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我也推荐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有些在意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没 单纯在发呆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想有多久 没放过烟花了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前经常来这里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实只在漫画里看过今天这样的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我好像想到画的主题了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没忘哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.75,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,决定好画啥了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没有和大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也好久没有和这么多人一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天也非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩得太开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,都忘了肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉创造了美好的夏日回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,明明都还没暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,画得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只要认真画的话这种程度…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.23,0:20:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那那那
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是那副吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,反正交出去了也会被别人看的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘛 好嘛 好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这次 我没画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说没画要参赛的画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就是 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我画的是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 没告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因为相机拍不到你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拍照就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拍照？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是吸血鬼 所以不会被拍下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我就在意这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我希望能让你留下回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这幅画
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能收下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不好意思交这幅画去比赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 那个 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有其他想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我收藏起来的这些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,星空非常美的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.55,0:21:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有还有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想去这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.61,0:21:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,消息那么灵通
Comment: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,========ED=======
